flowchart LR

  SF[/"`**studyflow** · required
  Study · Dataset · Table · Timeseries · Artifact`"/]
  PROV[/"`**prov** · required
  Activity — one entry of the trail`"/]
  COG[/"`**cognitive** · required
  CognitiveTask · Questionnaire · Actor · RandomGateway`"/]
  LOCAL[/"`**local** · required
  no elements: the study's default runtime`"/]

  BEHAVERSE[/"`**behaverse**
  Task · Dataset (BDM)`"/]
  EEG[/"`**eeg**
  Session · Recording`"/]
  AGENTIC[/"`**agentic**
  Agent · LLMCall · Tool · HumanApproval`"/]
  REACHY[/"`**reachy**
  Robot · Interact · LookAt`"/]
  BROWSER[/"`**browser**
  no elements: adds itself to the study's runtime choices`"/]

  SETTINGS["`**Settings › Extensions**
  the sets switch on and off here;
  a required one cannot be switched off`"]

  CATALOG["`**the loaded catalog**
  every enabled set compiled into one:
  the palette, the inspector tabs, the enum
  literals a set adds to another's, and the
  namespaces the XML may use`"]

  SF ==>|"always loads into"| CATALOG
  PROV ==>|"always loads into"| CATALOG
  COG ==>|"always loads into"| CATALOG
  LOCAL ==>|"always loads into"| CATALOG

  BEHAVERSE -->|"loads only when enabled in"| SETTINGS
  EEG -->|"loads only when enabled in"| SETTINGS
  AGENTIC -->|"loads only when enabled in"| SETTINGS
  REACHY -->|"loads only when enabled in"| SETTINGS
  BROWSER -->|"loads only when enabled in"| SETTINGS
  SETTINGS -->|"adds whatever is enabled to"| CATALOG

